\p \v 30 \w Now when Jehu|strong="H03058"\w* \w arrived|strong="H00935"\w* \w in Jezreel|strong="H03157"\w*, \w Jezebel|strong="H00348"\w* \w heard [of it]|strong="H08085"\w*. \w So she painted|strong="H07760"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06320"\w* \w her eyes|strong="H05869"\w*, \w adorned|strong="H03190"\w* \w -|strong="H00853"\w* \w her head|strong="H07218"\w*, \w and looked down|strong="H08259"\w* \w from|strong="H01157"\w* \w a window|strong="H02474"\w*. \v 31 \w And as Jehu|strong="H03058"\w* \w entered|strong="H00935"\w* \w the gate|strong="H08179"\w*, \w she asked|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Have you come in peace|strong="H07965"\w*, \w O Zimri|strong="H02174"\w*, \w murderer|strong="H02026"\w* \w of your master|strong="H00113"\w*?”\f + \fr 9:31 \ft Or \fqa “Is there peace for Zimri, the murderer of his master?”\ft See 1 Kings 16:10.\f*
\p \v 32 \w He looked up|strong="H05375"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06440"\w* \w at|strong="H00413"\w* \w the window|strong="H02474"\w* \w and called out|strong="H00559"\w*, “\w Who|strong="H04310"\w* \w is on my side|strong="H00854"\w*? \w Who|strong="H04310"\w*?”
