"H03372"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w your God|strong="H00430"\w*, \w and He|strong="H01931"\w* \w will deliver|strong="H05337"\w* \w you|strong="H00853"\w* \w from the hands|strong="H03027"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w your enemies|strong="H00341"\w*.”
